{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CaRGGtAnU11794901870.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太區股市普遍下跌。</p><p></p><p>日本股市延續上日跌勢，一度跌970點，失守59,000點關口。</p><p></p><p>韓國股市在晶片股拖累，跌穿5,000點重要關口。</p><p></p><p>台灣股市曾跌穿4萬點，收市跌逾900點。</p><p></p><p>澳洲股市在礦業及銀行股拖累，收市跌逾百分之1。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:51:18.081372+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T07:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T13:07:40.915849+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T08:44:29.370754+00:00","content_hash":"27f6230dc21e2b995a6276e96e42d6c26dcaad911370e30d0fcf302fbd448ee3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:51:18.081372+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}